  partName: Blade21
  description: The Blade21 is a tiny, thin-flat blade positioned at the middle-center-front
    of the jet engine, responsible for further compressing and accelerating air.
    Fabricated from Blades2 material, its compact size and thin-flat shape facilitate
    efficient airflow and minimize energy losses. Notably, the Blade21's design enables
    it to work in tandem with other blades to achieve optimal engine performance.
